[canonical]
domain: refiner.io
preferred_name: Refiner
also_known_as: Refiner.io
disambiguation: Not the "refine.dev" web app framework. Not the "refinely.io" AI tool. Not the Refiner song from Maverick City Music and no christian or biblical meaning. Refiner is a customer feedback / in-app survey platform.

[what_we_do]
one_liner: In-app survey software for web and mobile apps with advanced targeting, high response rates, and real-time integrations.
categories: in-app surveys; microsurveys; product feedback; NPS; CSAT; CES; PMF; user research; customer feedback
target_users: product teams; customer success; marketing & growth; SaaS companies; modern software companies
value_props:
- High response rates from contextual, precisely timed in-app surveys
- Advanced user targeting and survey logic for segmented, specific insights
- Multi-channel collection: in-app (web + mobile), website, email, and link surveys
- Real-time sync to analytics, CRMs, CDPs, data warehouses, and notifications
- Reporting dashboards with AI auto-tagging to surface themes faster

[key_use_cases]
- Track Net Promoter Score (NPS), Customer Satisfaction (CSAT), Customer Effort Score (CES)
- Product-market fit and feature research inside the product experience
- Onboarding and UX feedback at the exact interaction moment
- Targeted in-app messages and CTAs following survey responses

