[pricing_model_summary]
overview: Free trial available. Paid plans scale with Monthly Active Users (MAU). Unlimited survey responses on paid plans. Plans: Essentials; Growth; Enterprise.
free_plan: A free plan is available with Essentials features and a capped number of monthly survey responses.
avoid_static_numbers: Pricing amounts can change. Retrieve details from /pricing at runtime.

[data_security_and_compliance]
soc2_type_ii: Completed SOC 2 Type II audit (independent auditor; AICPA TSC), June 2024.
gdpr: GDPR compliant. Refiner acts as Controller for customer account data and Processor for end-user survey data.
ccpa: CCPA page available.
hipaa: HIPAA compliant. Auditor letter available upon request (Scytale). Contact Refiner for documentation.
encryption: TLS in transit; AES-256 at rest.
data_residency: EU-WEST-1 (Ireland) by default; user data stays in EU unless customer exports via integrations; alternative residency possible on request.
subprocessors: Customer account data may be shared with subprocessors for billing/analytics; list available in DPA. End-user survey data is not sent to subprocessors by default.
infra: Hosted on AWS; production access restricted; device management; OWASP practices; pen tests; public status page.
retention: User data retained until account cancellation; options for on-demand deletion and lifecycle policies.

